# Release artifacts are uploaded as GitHub release ASSETS, never committed.
# GitHub hard-limits committed files at 100 MB and the LXC templates are ~247 MB;
# a large blob in history is painful to remove. publish-release.sh uploads them.
*.deb
*.tar.zst
*-Setup.exe
SHA256SUMS
artifacts/

# Never in this repo: product source, keys, credentials.
*.age
*passphrase*
*.pub
